d not let  fian die with  thanking him he knew he was ready to  sacrifice himself for the greater good  of the realm say what you want about  Theon but he went out like a soldier he  knew that he had no chance of killing  the night king but he gave it a try  anyway I have to respect that because  that took heart I actually wasn't sure  what happened to ragle until I saw the  trailer for the next episode I was not  able to see where he went during the  fight but he is in the trailer for the  next episode so I know that he did make  it out of the battle Daenerys and John  will certainly need both of the dragons  because they lost a shitload of men now  it should be interesting to see how they  take on Cersei and you're on next  like I said I just wanted to give some  of my initial thoughts on tonight's  episode because I know all of you wanted  me to release a video as soon as I could  I will make a full breakdown video next  as of right now I only saw the episode  one time so I will need to watch it  again to see what all I might have  missed  obviously there are so many more things  that I need to discuss hopefully you all  come back for that next video anyways I  want to thank you all for watching and I  want to thank everyone that supports the  channel I really appreciate that have a  good day I'll see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

